OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers protest tax changes ahead
OL,4,Aof budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarmers have gathered in Berkshire to
OL,7,Fprotest changes to inheritance tax.
OL,9,FAfter initially proposing that a 20%
OL,10,Ftax would be paid on inherited
OL,11,Fagricultural assets worth more than #1m
OL,12,Ffrom April, the government announced in
OL,13,FDecember that the threshold would go up
OL,14,Fto #2.5m.
OL,16,FDespite the changes, the protesting
OL,17,Ffarmers want to see the tax changes
OL,18,Fintroduced in April axed entirely.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
