OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers protest tax changes ahead
OL,4,Aof budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government spokesperson said it
OL,7,Fvalued "hardworking farmers" and the
OL,8,Fraised threshold would "protect small
OL,9,Ffamily farms and businesses while
OL,10,Fensuring the largest estates make a
OL,11,Ffair contribution".
